  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to transform an existing UNDP internal data platform (Crisis Risk Dashboard) into a digital public good by providing a one-stop data warehouse for over 15,000 indicators combining a large set of public datasets to facilitate integrated multidimensional data analytics. This cost-effective solution enables efficient access to valuable data, promotes evidence-based decision-making, and strengthens response efforts in crisis situations, ultimately advancing sustainable development a</narrative>
  </description>
